    "text": "By cfelixcpa ,\n10 hours ago February 2, 2026 – HCA Florida JFK Hospital and HCA Florida JFK North Hospital today announced the appointment of four new members to the hospitals’ shared Board of Trustees. The Board provides governance and strategic guidance in support of both facilities and plays a critical role in advancing high-quality, patient-centered care across Palm Beach County. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
